          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa uno owa bafukula, bari Niwina owakhukhola iwe omuruchi kata omukhalachi weshiina? Neniye owa Nyasaye yaruma abe omuruchi khandi omununuli, khulwa omukhono kwamalaika owamuloleshela mushitsakha eshio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omundu uno yabeemilila nabarusia, olwa yali nakholile amangaliimwa nende ebilolelo eMisiri, nende muNyanza Inzakhanyu, nende mushitsiimi, emiyika amakhumi kane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uno niye Musa watsana owasunjila abaana baIsiraeli ari Nyasaye alamubuusilia omunabii okhurula mubaluyia beenywe, owingana isie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uno neniye owali nali mukanisa tsana mushitsiimi, halala nende malaika owasungana ninaye mushikulu shiaSinai, khandi nende abakuuka beefwe; neniye owabukula amasungo amalamu okhukhuheelesia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
