          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inywe abamakosi amoomu, ababula eshishebo mumwoyo kata amarwi ta, mukhayanga Roho Omutakatifu; shinga abakuuka beenywe olwa bakhola, nolwa mukholanga murio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali heena khubanabii owa abakuuka beenywe barasandia ta? Kata babeeranga abo abalakulanga akokhwitsa khwOmulunjishi oyo; owa inywe bulaano mwikholile abakhobi nende abeeribe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inywe ninywe abaheebwa amalako mumakhono kabamalaika, ne shimwakahulila ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.53"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sitefano yalaswa namachina",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho olwa bahulila amakhuwa ako, bayia munda, nibamulumaasilia ameeno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habula ye, niyeetsuulemwo Roho Omutakatifu, yoomisia tsimoni okhuhenga mwikulu, nalola oluyali lwaNyasaye, nende Yesu nasinjiile khumukhono musaatsa kwaNyasaye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naboola mbu Lole, endola likulu niliikuushe, nende Omwana wOmundu nasinjiile khumukhono musaatsa kwaNyasaye! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo nibayiiba nende omwoyo omukhongo, nibasiba amarwi. Nibamukwakhwo tsimbilo nomwoyo mulala, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.57"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "58",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:58"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nibamurusia mwitookho nibamulasa namachina. Nabo abaloli nibara tsingubo tsiabwe hamakulu komusooliili undi oulangwa mbu Saulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.58",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.58"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "59",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:59"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibamulasa Sitefano namachina, nalanjisia Omwami, nasunga ari Omwami Yesu, obukule roho yanje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.59",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.59"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "60",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:60"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "60",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nasikama hasi, nalanga nomwoyo omukhongo, ari Omwami, orababasiliakhwo eshionoono shino ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.60",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.60"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
